  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=2$ and then evaluate the absolute values before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x+1{|}^{2}-|x-1{|}^{3}+2 & = \\\\ |2+1{|}^{2}-|2-1{|}^{3}+2 & = \\\\ |3{|}^{2}-|1{|}^{3}+2 & = \\\\ {3}^{2}-{1}^{3}+2 & = \\\\ 9-1+2 & = \\\\ 10 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
